  "body": "When it comes to a sought-after lifestyle location, an endless list of great features in the home or potentially huge upside via development of the flat 809sqm site (Mixed Housing Urban) ...come and get it all!\r\n\r\nSecure yourself a coastal lifestyle location, high on the Mairangi Bay ridge, handy to so many amenities! Various bus routes, Constellation Dr bus station and motorway access; Mairangi Bay beach, coastal walks, a host of sports clubs, numerous shops, restaurants and cafes; lots of reserves and parks. Your schooling options are also numerous. Starting off with in-zone primary and intermediate schools of Mairangi Bay and Murrays Bay being just a short stroll away and then the rare secondary school zone trifecta of Rangitoto College, Westlake Boys and Girls.\r\n\r\nThe property itself is a well presented, solid 1960's weatherboard and concrete tile, with an easy living, flexible, one level floor plan to suit growing families. Entertainers and gardeners will love the expansive open plan kitchen adjoining large dining and lounge, seamlessly flowing to a large louvre covered deck, garden and lawn areas. It is a stunning, private oasis at the rear! The second formal lounge can link to this or be closed off by large sliders. The northerly aspect not only brings in the sun but also lovely sea views. Fully fenced and gated, the kids and the pooch will be safe as houses! The bedrooms are spacious (master ensuite), there is loads of storage and a study, the double int access garage is oversized, the extra parking makes coming and going a breeze for all and easily accommodates a boat or caravan. There is also a large shed for more toys!\r\n\r\nFor those looking for upside and not just a home, this property caters for you too! Adjust the floor plan, renovate further, extend outwards or upwards, add a swimming pool...the large site allows fantastic options. Should you be a shrewd developer looking to capture an outstanding high density development option, be sure to review all the scope current council rules allow. Flat, sunny building sites like this with sea views afford a truly rare opportunity.\r\n\r\nOur vendors have enjoyed over 25 years of superb family living and have now made the decision to head up north asap so be sure to make your decision fast! Call now for a private viewing or see you at the open homes. (Please paste this URL into your browser to download information files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/5VLN )",
